  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added support for thin-thick BorderStyle in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with fitting paragraph below drawing in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with fixed 'table-layout' on table without specified width in HTML reader.\nFixed issue with mail merge extending segment when replacing field with block elements.\nFixed issue with extracting DocumentModelPage content.\nFixed issue with TextBox without block elements in DOCX reader.\nFixed issue with text frame's default internal margin.\nFixed issue with line shapes in high-fidelity PDF reader.\nFixed issue with too many nested 'div' elements in HTML reader.\nAdded support for text fill and outline on Run elements in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with WMF playback context in DOCX reader.\nFixed issue with default PaperType.A4 when dimensions matched another paper size in DOCX reader.\nFixed issue with base64 data from 'background-image' in HTML reader.\nAdded support for bold and italic font simulations in PDF writer.",
